Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=12}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:57.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This looks suspiciously like a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:02:02.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,treasure map. And it seems to be\Npointing to Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:10.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I can't believe you have the nerve\Nto go through my personal belongings!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's my map and it has\Nnothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:16.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So angry... Is there\Nsomething on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:21.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.31,0:02:25.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are all these guys dead?\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.48,0:02:27.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pirate hunter Zoro did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:31.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why weren't you here, Hatchi? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This could've been prevented,\Nhad you been here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:35.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course it could've!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:37.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Had I only been here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:40.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:42.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We get it. You weren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.01,0:02:44.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you don't know where\Nhe is, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:48.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, let me think about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:50.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw one guy. Yeah, that's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.76,0:02:53.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was a slightly\Nsuspicious swordsman type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:57.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:01.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}did{\i0} see him, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:03.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So where did he go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:08.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He told me he wanted to see Arlong,\Nso I gave him a ride to Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.81,0:03:14.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excellent... That means we\Ndon't have any need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:18.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's going to come straight to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:22.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Arlong, but if I had known\Nyou were going to be back so soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:23.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would have kept him here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:26.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But he said he was a guest and\NI thought I should get him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:28.52,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,to the village as fast as I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:30.19,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:33.69,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Which means if I can buy\Njust a little more time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.65,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep\Ngetting in the way?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:45.91,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything's so close to\Nworking out! So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:00.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Nami!\NYou want a fight, don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:02.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:04.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're the one getting in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is what you get\Nfor messing with Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:10.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, you've\Nreally disappointed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Even after you stole\Nour ship and ran off,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:16.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy had complete faith in you.\NHe trusts you completely,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and you haven't even\Nshown an ounce of guilt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:21.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you betray someone like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you really that cold-hearted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:25.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only thing I trust is money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:27.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those dumb enough to\Nbe fooled deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:28.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:34.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You idiots... It was\Ngoing according to plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:41.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm not about to let you and your\Nfriends ruin eight long years of hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:45.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So long, Usopp. It's just business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:46.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:49.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:52.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like you became a\Npirate while you were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:54.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So long...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:58.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What, like you're gonna kill {\i1}me{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:05:03.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right... I wouldn't\Nunderestimate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:06.12,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Aww, crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.12,0:05:08.87,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, I'm a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:10.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Special attack...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.05,0:05:15.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...Smoke Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:29.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is just like\Nsomething you'd think up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:34.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.93,0:05:50.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This was my only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, how could you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now go and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:16.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it! Big\NSis Nami... killed Big Bro Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:22.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your wish came true... You died at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.81,0:06:25.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami.\NI'm sorry for doubting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without question... You're our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:29.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:34.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's only one reason\NI joined this group.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.68,0:06:37.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that's to buy Cocoyashi\NVillage from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.57,0:06:40.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ya got that? Just business. Not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:45.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Keep your end of the deal and\NI'll have those berries soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.55,0:06:46.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:51.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'd rather cut my stomach open and die\Nthan break a promise concerning money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.85,0:06:54.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of man I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:57.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it, Arlong.\NYou know the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:01.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She gives me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:06.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a great\Nwoman she's become!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:11.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's dead... She killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That witch killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.07,0:07:19.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There it is! Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:26.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Keep up the pace, cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:27.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:30.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji's kicks must've\Nreally taken their toll!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not that way!\NGo to your other left!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:35.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the building stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.05,0:07:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's almost like we're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:00.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Almost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We {\i1}are{\i0} flying, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:04.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! We're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.89,0:08:14.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Landing successful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:22.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:23.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Awesome. We're here, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.59,0:08:43.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whaddya mean? We're here\Nto pick up Nami. Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come you haven't found her yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:52.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. And what about\NUsopp and Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, we gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:08:58.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.93,0:09:01.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That dumbass has\Nbeen caught by Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:03.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry before they kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's already dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:06.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:08.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:13.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Usopp is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami... murdered him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:23.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– C'mon! Hurry up!\N– What's the deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:25.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2}The Marines are here! We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:28.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Some survivors from Gosa managed\Nto contact the government
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:29.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they told 'em what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:33.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now the Marines\Nare here to rescue us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:34.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:38.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finally! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:42.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now we get to leave\Nthis horrible place!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So this is\Nthe infamous Arlong Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What is the world coming to when pirate\Nscum can set up such an opulent base?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:54.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen up, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:57.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our noble mission today\Nis one of extraction!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:10:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We must rescue the survivors\Nof the town of Gosa,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:04.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which was savagely destroyed\Nby the Arlong Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.43,0:10:06.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I am left to wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.66,0:10:09.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would our brand of\Nswift and terrible justice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.17,0:10:14.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}allow us to simply overlook the decadent\Nfortress of these unchecked brutes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:16.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir, no, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:22.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Correct! Our unit must annihilate\NArlong and his men! Prepare for battle at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.57,0:10:23.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:26.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that right? Marine branch 77?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.57,0:10:28.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.51,0:10:29.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A newcomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:32.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll have someone negotiate\Nwith the man in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:34.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If two million isn't enough\Nto keep them from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.58,0:10:37.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,trying anything funny, then kill\Nevery last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:43.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!\NThe Marines have opened fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:45.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:58.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa. He crushed a cannonball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those jaws are terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:02.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what now? Are the talks...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:06.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:07.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:09.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've\Nbeen waitin' for a good fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:11.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a bloodbath!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:14.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choo. Hold on, guys, not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:21.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There's no need to expend so much energy\Njust to take out the trash. Choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:26.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What foolish humans they are\Nto pick a fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In our own waters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:32.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those Marines don't stand a chance\Nagainst three of our leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:34.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I doubt that ship will make it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:36.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a full three minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:39.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:41.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore.\NSeems that cannonball was a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.88,0:11:43.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire another!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:45.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a signal of open hostility!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:47.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never drop your guard when\Nyou're dealing with fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:48.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:52.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man down!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:54.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's one of them! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:56.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stand down, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.87,0:11:59.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One of Arlong's men, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.60,0:12:04.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am Commodore Purinpurin\Nof Marines branch number 77.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:05.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Allow me to elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, we are a somewhat\Nwell-known elite Marine unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you understand\Nwhat I'm telling you, fishman?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you wish to live,\Nsurrender immediately and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:15.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.74,0:12:18.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What have you done to him?!\N– You killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's all this shaking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:23.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me there are\Nfishmen under the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:30.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry to\Ninconvenience you like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but we just took the liberty\Nof removing your rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:33.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:36.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Uh! You what?\N– Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:41.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Choo. Don't worry, I didn't\Nhit any of his vital organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.77,0:12:43.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Commodore, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just hypothetical, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If one were to move a large reef\Ndirectly into a strong current,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.63,0:12:52.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what do you suppose\Nwould happen to the ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.44,0:12:59.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No. Moving a whole reef?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That can't be done,\Nit's just not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:04.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Put it down over there, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:06.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:07.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh...! Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A giant\Nwhirlpool has just appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:10.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rudder isn't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:11.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.92,0:13:14.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you.\NWe removed the rudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:21.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So now this rudderless ship is headed\Nstraight... choo... to the sea floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:40.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. And so is hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:46.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to face the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.48,0:13:49.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way to escape\NArlong's control.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.45,0:13:56.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't even break a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:57.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We know everything about these waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:00.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from the winds to the depths.\NIt was quite easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With our expert knowledge of these\Nwaters, no one can beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:06.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,True, but let's not\Nforget Nami's charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.11,0:14:09.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Indeed. They are excellent charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:12.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we could persuade Nami to do\Nthis for all the world's oceans,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.95,0:14:16.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we would be the undisputed\Nrulers of the sea forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know. Nami's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:21.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In fact, she could be\Ncritical in the creation
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.29,0:14:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the Arlong Empire.\NIt's just a shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:24.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:27.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He promised to let Nami\Nand Cocoyashi Village go
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.63,0:14:30.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,once she saves up 100 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.97,0:14:34.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do,\Nyou can't let her leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:34.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:39.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was what we\Nagreed upon eight years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:44.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm the kind of man who always keeps\Nmy promises when it comes to money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.22,0:14:48.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Say another word and you'll regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:50.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Easy, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:51.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.73,0:14:53.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on, believe whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.20,0:14:57.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I know what I saw!\NNami killed Big Bro Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:15:01.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth! Never in a\Nmillion years would Nami kill Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.07,0:15:03.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't do that to her friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.87,0:15:05.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... But I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:09.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What was that about friends, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:12.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Nami!\N– What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:14.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:17.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're our friend! We came to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.09,0:15:19.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What a pest.\N– Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:22.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Friends, huh? Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:24.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're just pathetic enough\Nto deserve each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.74,0:15:27.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You killed him! I watched you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.83,0:15:32.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now... Big Bro Usopp is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:36.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So why don't you kill me\Nand get your revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eh... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.32,0:15:40.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Word to the wise, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.99,0:15:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because of your "friend's" stupidity,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.49,0:15:47.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arlong is preparing to kill Zoro\Nalong with his entire crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.77,0:15:51.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I don't care how monstrously\Nstrong you guys think you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:54.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you're no match for the {\i1}real{\i0} monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:59.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hi, Nami! It's me, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:01.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's run away together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:04.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can it, Romeo! This isn't\Nthe time or place for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:05.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:08.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Love is like a hurricane, so back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:10.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at me\Nwhen I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:11.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, where is Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:15.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– With the fishes.\N– Damn it! Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.81,0:16:21.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How sad,\Na swordsman striking a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.51,0:16:23.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Can't you see\Nwhat's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.98,0:16:25.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're starting to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:29.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh. If someone had stopped me\Nthat easily, I'd be mad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:31.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.59,0:16:33.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You... should watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:37.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll say whatever I want, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:38.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.45,0:16:39.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're all in this together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is no time to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.65,0:16:42.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your pal's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.79,0:16:45.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now quit your bickering\Nand leave while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You outsiders have no right\Nto butt into this island's affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:52.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The only reason\NI got close to you idiots
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:55.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was so that I could rob you\Nof everything you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:58.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But now that you're broke,\Nit looks like the dream's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.09,0:16:59.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So go, take your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.17,0:17:04.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go on. Find a navigator dumb enough\Nto join you and go to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:07.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Continue on your quest to find\Nthe One Piece or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:09.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just leave here! You're an eyesore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:14.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Goodbye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.98,0:17:25.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.75,0:17:27.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Sleepy.\N– Sleep?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.38,0:17:29.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the road?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:32.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm pretty tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:34.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna butt into their affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.47,0:17:38.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I'm not leaving either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Night.\N– Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:47.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:50.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever! Just go ahead and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:57.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Big Bro Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.07,0:18:00.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you thinking?! C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:02.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you forget that\NArlong is out to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:04.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We should be running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:08.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Now that we know what Nami's really like,\Nthere isn't a single good reason why
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.31,0:18:09.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we should stay on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:15.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right. Understood. You're not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:17.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry to cut our reunion short,\Nbut I won't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My role as guide ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.16,0:18:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:23.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't want to deliberately\Nget myself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fine. I'll see ya around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.57,0:18:28.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until we meet again, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:29.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take care, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:31.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:51.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you still honestly believe\Nthat Nami could've killed Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,When she did that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's for my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:06.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This was my only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.31,0:19:15.76,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When she did that... Nami stabbed her\Nown hand to make it look like she stabbed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.09,0:19:20.10,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe she did that for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:24.31,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But it's a good thing she did, otherwise\NI'd be fish food right now for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:25.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,But what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:30.11,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,A manly man like me can't just turn\Ntail and run after being saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:31.48,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,One step at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:33.57,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Right now I gotta hurry and find Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:36.32,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that him up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.81,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,It is! It's Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.81,0:19:41.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So Nami didn't kill him.\NIs that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh. Well, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.95,0:19:47.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I always thought of her as\Nkind of a small-time crook
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:50.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who wouldn't even watch\Na guy die, let alone kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:51.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But maybe she just snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's not small-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.93,0:19:58.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is she all you think about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:04.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.17,0:20:05.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:08.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(477,0,1,\c&H070705&\3c&H070705&\4c&H070705&)}I hope he still is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:29.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Nami. You sure know\Nhow to trash a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:32.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.49,0:20:36.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I'm just\Nresting a little, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.49,0:20:38.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean to tell me that\Nporing over a treasure map
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.89,0:20:43.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after wrecking a house\Nis how you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not fooling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.13,0:20:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now fess up already.\NWhat's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.53,0:20:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You can\Ntell me anything, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.59,0:20:56.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something happened\Nto make me mad. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:59.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those guys? Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:01.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:03.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I met some captain guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.99,0:21:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He seemed kind of liar-ish, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:14.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that would hit her hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:22.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To think that someone\Nactually showed up for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.87,0:21:30.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That word... means pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It breaks her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:36.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:38.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did Nami do all this to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:40.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Zoro and I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}you{\i0} did!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy. You're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:46.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep. Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:48.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm here, too. Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.59,0:21:50.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One of these days I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.81,0:21:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! You just made a full recovery!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:53.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:57.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, and by the way, we kinda heard\Nyou were dead. Killed by Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.31,0:21:59.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Huh?\N– Stupid Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was spouting nonsense\Nthat entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:06.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, in a way... it is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:10.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But, I'm alive... 'cause you see,\Nshe actually saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:12.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks to me like she's got\Nsome sorta hidden motive
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.67,0:22:15.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for hangin' out with\Na bunch of renegade fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:17.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Obviously.\N– Fine. What next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.51,0:22:19.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We gonna destroy Arlong Park?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:20.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hang on just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.86,0:22:23.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we'd better find\Nout what's going on with Nami first?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.52,0:22:25.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no use either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:29.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No matter what you guys do,\NArlong's rule won't come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.73,0:22:30.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:31.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:32.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami's big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:36.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Nami's sister.\NNo wonder she's so hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.47,0:22:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean that "it's no use"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.67,0:22:40.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just trust me. Don't\Nget yourselves involved
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.80,0:22:44.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in what's going on here.\NAnd leave poor Nami alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.17,0:22:45.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll explain the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:49.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And if that doesn't get\Nyou to leave, I don't know what will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:51.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, there's\Na Marine ship at the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:53.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's branch 16's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.71,0:22:58.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Maybe headquarters is finally taking action\Nafter what happened to branch 77!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.68,0:23:04.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm Colonel Nezumi of branch 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.95,0:23:08.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now then. Genzo, please step up.\NAnd make it snappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:11.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Colonel.\NI'm the one you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.68,0:23:15.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You, huh?\NTake me to Nami's house at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.88,0:23:17.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.65,0:23:19.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't understand\Nwhat's going on, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.99,0:23:23.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lead the way. That is\Nall you'll need to do.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=13}===============================DIALOGUE============================
